uential\nlogic is triggered on the positive edge of the clock.\n\n\n\nCANDIDATE RTL:\n```verilog\nmodule TopModule (\n    input clk,\n    input d,\n    input q\n);\n\n    // D flip-flop\n    reg q_reg;\n\n    // D flip-flop logic\n    always @(posedge clk) begin\n        if (d) begin\n            q_reg <= d;\n        end\n    end\n\n    // Output the current state of the D flip-flop\n    assign q = q_reg;\n\nendmodule\n```\n",
